# NOTE: public/build is intentionally COMMITTED. The VPS runs Node 18, but Vite 7
# needs Node 20.19+, so `vite build` fails on deploy and the frontend never
# rebuilds. Committing the compiled assets makes `git reset` ship them directly.
# Once the VPS is upgraded to Node 20+, this can be re-ignored.
